! BOLSIG+ 07/2024. Original example2 cross sections.
NOSCREEN
NOLOGFILE

READCOLLISIONS
bolsigdb.dat         / From ZDPlasKin example2 at the revision in the summary YAML
Ar Ar*
1                    / Cross section extrapolation

CONDITIONS
10.                  / E/N in Td, replaced by RUNSERIES
0.                   / DC
0.                   / No magnetic field
300.                 / Gas temperature, K
300.                 / Excitation temperature, K
0.                   / Transition energy
0.                   / Ionization degree
3.218830947284555e24  / Neutral density, m^-3
1.                   / Ion charge parameter
1.                   / Ion/neutral mass ratio
0                    / Coulomb collision model
1                    / Equal energy sharing
1                    / Temporal growth
0.                   / Solve the EEDF
650                  / Energy grid points
0                    / Automatic energy grid
200.                 / Maximum for manual grid
1e-11                / Precision
1e-6                 / Convergence
1000                 / Iteration limit
1. 0.                / Ar and Ar* fractions; evaluate both targets
1                    / Normalize fractions

RUNSERIES
1                    / E/N
1.5 85.
641
3                    / Exponential grid

SAVERESULTS
independent.dat
3                    / E/N tabulation
1                    / Conditions
1                    / Transport
1                    / Collision rates
0                    / Reverse rate section
0                    / Energy loss section
0                    / Distribution
0                    / Keep failed runs visible
0                    / Cross sections
